# Bundles of the PRODUCT'S own code, emitted by scripts/build-product.sh out of
# ~/CompoundLabs/clausewatch. Not committed: they are a copy of another repository's source, they
# go stale the moment that repository moves, and a committed copy is the exact thing
# scripts/build-product.sh exists to avoid. Run that script to rebuild them; scripts/up.sh does.
.build/
